  {
   "id": 614601,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Ultimately, Montezuma invited Cortés into Tenochtitlan because ",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1166378,
     "content_html": "Montezuma felt it better to negotiate on his terms rather than risk outright war\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 1166377,
     "content_html": "Cortés forced his way through the city walls and Montezuma had no choice\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 1166376,
     "content_html": "Montezuma interpreted a comet as an omen indicating he should meet with the Spanish\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 1166375,
     "content_html": "Montezuma reasoned that refusing to meet with the Spanish would lead to an outbreak of disease\n"
    }
   ],
